-
-### otel_metrics_sum
-Counter/sum metrics (cumulative values like token counts).
-
-| Column | Type | Description |
-|--------|------|-------------|
-| ResourceAttributes | Map(String, String) | Resource attributes |
-| ScopeName | String | Scope name |
-| ScopeVersion | String | Scope version |
